<h1>Hardware Settings - Localiser (Faro Advanced Settings)</h1>
<hr align="left" width="100.526%" size="5" class="whs3">
<h2 class="whs4">Advanced Settings in Localiser Tab</h2>
<p>If the FARO localiser is connected to the PC, click on the '<span class="Button">Advanced Settings'</span> button and the following window will appear:</p>
<p><img src="../faro_adv.jpg" width="322px" height="199px" border="0" class="img_whs5" alt=""></p>
<p>This dialogue contains one section for serial port settings and four buttons:</p>
<p class="parameterstitle">Serial Port Settings</p>
<p class="parameterdescription">These are automatically detected and displayed in the localiser tab. If 'Auto detect' box is unchecked you can manually change these settings.</p>
<p class="parameterstitle">Terminal button</p>
<p class="parameterdescription">It is used to send communication commands to the localiser and show results in the <a class="dropspot" href="javascript:kadovTextPopup(this)" id="a1"><span>response window</span></a>.</p>
<div class="droptext" id="POPUP171663216" style="display:'none'; x-ss-type:dropdown;">
<p><img src="../terminal.jpg" width="402px" height="285px" border="0" class="img_whs6" alt=""></p>
</div>
<p class="Note"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Note:</b></span> More information about the commands, their meaning and use can be found in Caliper 3D Help.</p>
<p class="parameterstitle">Select probe button</p>
<p class="parameterdescription">Chooses the real probe type, used in your system.</p>
<p><img src="../select_probe.jpg" width="325px" height="199px" border="0" class="img_whs7" alt=""></p>
<p>The real probe diameter should be automatically detected, but if some differences appear you can change the probe type and diameter in this window. The value set in this dialogue will be updated in the localiser tab and then used in KUBE as default.</p>
<h2 class="whs4">Adjoining Information Section in Localiser tab</h2>
<p class="whs8">The information in this section depends on the values set in the advanced settings dialogue.</p>
<p class="Example" style="text-decoration:underline;"><a class="dropspot" href="javascript:kadovTextPopup(this)" id="a2" style="text-decoration:underline;">Example</a></p>
<div class="droptext" id="POPUP169037521" style="display:'none'; x-ss-type:dropdown;">
<p class="Normal" style="text-align:justify;"><img src="../faro_adj.jpg" width="512px" height="94px" border="0" class="img_whs9" alt=""></p>
</div>
<p class="parameterstitle">'Serial port settings'</p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><span>Displays the settings of the serial port to which the localiser is connected, e.g. Port ID, Baud rate, Data bits, Stop bits, Parity.</span></p>
<p class="parameterstitle">'Arm response'</p>
<p class="parameterdescription">Displays the information extracted when the localiser is detected.</p>
